  "question": {
    "text": "The equation <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math>&nbsp;solution(s) in <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mtext>f</mtext><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mtext>x</mtext></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mtext>x</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mtext>x</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>sinx</mtext></math><br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>f</mtext> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mtext>x</mtext> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>x</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>x</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> </mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>sinx</mtext></mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>f</mtext> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mtext>x</mtext> </mfenced></mrow> </math> is always positive as the minimum value of <math><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mn>3</mn></math> and that of <math><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow></math> is <math><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></math> so <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></math> is increasing in <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has no solution in <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
